title Settings, Input with pointer speed, mouse gestures and keep-awake interval (FR-501..504/711)
settings 1
section input
mouse_sensitivity 1
longpress_right_click 1
two_finger_scroll 1
natural_scroll 0
awake 1
awake_s 120
